content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Business Owner",
      "description": "Person responsible for submitting records and approving financial actions."
    },
    {
      "name": "Monthly Sales Document",
      "description": "Report showing sales activity for a given month."
    },
    {
      "name": "Expense",
      "description": "Cost incurred by the business that must be recorded."
    },
    {
      "name": "Accountant",
      "description": "Professional who prepares entries, reviews data, and manages invoices."
    },
    {
      "name": "Account",
      "description": "Financial record containing entries, owner details, and receipts.",
      "attributes": [
        "Financial Entry",
        "Business Owner",
        "Receipt"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Financial Entry",
      "description": "Recorded financial transaction created from business documents."
    },
    {
      "name": "Receipt",
      "description": "Proof of purchase used to validate expenses."
    },
    {
      "name": "Invoice",
      "description": "Billing document issued to a client for services or products."
    },
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "Customer who receives invoices and pays the business."
    },
    {
      "name": "Bookkeeper",
      "description": "Person who records expenses and organizes receipts."
    },
    {
      "name": "Inconsistency Notification",
      "description": "Message alerting the accountant about missing or conflicting data."
    },
    {
      "name": "Auditor",
      "description": "Independent reviewer ensuring financial statements meet regulations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Financial Statement",
      "description": "Formal report summarizing the business’s financial performance."
    },
    {
      "name": "Regulations",
      "description": "Financial rules and standards the business must follow."
    },
    {
      "name": "Document Request",
      "description": "Request from the auditor to obtain additional documentation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Supporting Document",
      "description": "Additional evidence provided to verify financial transactions."
    },
    {
      "name": "Finance Review",
      "description": "Final assessment confirming compliance with financial rules."
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name the two related objects and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Business Owner",
      "to": "Monthly Sales Document",
      "description": "Business Owner submits Monthly Sales Documents."
    },
    {
      "from": "Business Owner",
      "to": "Expense",
      "description": "Business Owner authorizes or creates Expenses."
    },
    {
      "from": "Accountant",
      "to": "Monthly Sales Document",
      "description": "Accountant reviews Monthly Sales Documents."
    },
    {
      "from": "Accountant",
      "to": "Account",
      "description": "Accountant updates the Account with financial entries."
    },
    {
      "from": "Accountant",
      "to": "Invoice",
      "description": "Accountant creates an Invoice."
    },
    {
      "from": "Invoice",
      "to": "Client",
      "description": "Invoice is issued to the Client."
    },
    {
      "from": "Client",
      "to": "Business Owner",
      "description": "Client is connected to the Business Owner as the service provider."
    },
    {
      "from": "Bookkeeper",
      "to": "Expense",
      "description": "Bookkeeper records Expenses."
    },
    {
      "from": "Bookkeeper",
      "to": "Inconsistency Notification",
      "description": "Bookkeeper generates an Inconsistency Notification."
    },
    {
      "from": "Inconsistency Notification",
      "to": "Accountant",
      "description": "Inconsistency Notification is sent to the Accountant."
    },
    {
      "from": "Bookkeeper",
      "to": "Receipt",
      "description": "Bookkeeper organizes Receipts."
    },
    {
      "from": "Business Owner",
      "to": "Financial Statement",
      "description": "Business Owner provides Financial Statements."
    },
    {
      "from": "Auditor",
      "to": "Financial Statement",
      "description": "Auditor reviews Financial Statements."
    },
    {
      "from": "Auditor",
      "to": "Document Request",
      "description": "Auditor creates a Document Request."
    },
    {
      "from": "Document Request",
      "to": "Auditor",
      "description": "Document Request is returned to the Auditor."
    },
    {
      "from": "Auditor",
      "to": "Finance Review",
      "description": "Auditor performs the Finance Review."
    },
    {
      "from": "Business Owner",
      "to": "Finance Review",
      "description": "Business Owner receives the Finance Review."
    },
    {
      "from": "Business Owner",
      "to": "Supporting Document",
      "description": "Business Owner provides Supporting Documents."
    },
    {
      "from": "Auditor",
      "to": "Supporting Document",
      "description": "Auditor examines Supporting Documents."
    },
    {
      "from": "Auditor",
      "to": "Regulations",
      "description": "Auditor checks compliance with Regulations."
    }
  ]
}
```
